#: savesettingswidget.cpp:75
msgid "Output file format:"
msgstr ""

#: savesettingswidget.cpp:81
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the ouput file format to use:"
"<p><b>JPEG</b>: output the processed image in JPEG Format. Warning!!! JPEG is a "
"lossy format, but will give smaller-sized files. Minimum JPEG compression will "
"be used during conversion."
"<p><b>TIFF</b>: output the processed image in TIFF Format. This generates "
"larges, without losing quality. Adobe Deflate compression will be used during "
"conversion."
"<p><b>PPM</b>: output the processed image in PPM Format. This generates the "
"largest files, without losing quality."
"<p><b>PNG</b>: output the processed image in PNG Format. This generates larges, "
"without losing quality. Maximum PNG compression will be used during conversion."
msgstr ""

